@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Métricas operacionais
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Dead letters
GET {{baseUrl}}/dead-letters

### Enviar evento válido
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-001",
  "type": "payment.created",
  "payload": {
    "amount": 100,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}


### Evento duplicado: repetir evt-001 deve retornar 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-001",
  "type": "payment.created",
  "payload": {
    "amount": 100,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}
### Enviar segundo evento válido
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-002",
  "type": "order.approved",
  "payload": {
    "orderId": "ord-123",
    "customerId": "cus-456"
  }
}

### Simular falha de processamento para testar retry/backoff
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-fail-001",
  "type": "payment.created",
  "payload": {
    "simulateFailure": true
  }
}

### Evento inválido: sem id
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "payment.created",
  "payload": {
    "amount": 100
  }
}

### Evento inválido: sem type
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-invalid-001",
  "payload": {
    "amount": 100
  }
}

### JSON inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "evt-invalid-json",
  "type": "payment.created",
  "payload": {
    "amount": 100
  }



